\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces One bridge question over the frozen procurement graph. Retrieval-augmented reading retrieves 40 records, among them all 23 naming the supplier, and answers 14; an untuned model of the same size emits a program that type checks and executes cleanly but stops after the first hop and returns 23. Our runtime executes the two-hop bridge exhaustively---23 source records, 16 buyer values, 4{,}257 notices---and releases an answer only once execution, evidence, and answer-sanity checks pass. Every value comes from one saved run; its provenance and limits are given in Appendix \ref  {app:examples}.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:visual-thesis}{{1}{2}{One bridge question over the frozen procurement graph. Retrieval-augmented reading retrieves 40 records, among them all 23 naming the supplier, and answers 14; an untuned model of the same size emits a program that type checks and executes cleanly but stops after the first hop and returns 23. Our runtime executes the two-hop bridge exhaustively---23 source records, 16 buyer values, 4{,}257 notices---and releases an answer only once execution, evidence, and answer-sanity checks pass. Every value comes from one saved run; its provenance and limits are given in Appendix \ref {app:examples}}{figure.1}{}}
